    "hint": "Compare what the patient understands with what they can produce.",
    "e": "Effortful output with relatively preserved comprehension fits a nonfluent, Broca-type pattern. A fluent receptive pattern would show a different profile. The vignette supports a pattern and cannot localise all damage.",
