      "Check attendance and participation by subgroup before deciding whether the timing met the access goal",
      "Ask the most experienced members to summarize the group's concerns and build the agenda around the priorities they identify",
      "Invite written suggestions after the meeting while keeping the established discussion format and decision timetable in place",
      "Divide members into separate groups according to experience and let each group appoint a spokesperson to present one agreed position",
      "Ask the facilitator to select the most practical proposal and use the remaining meeting time to explain how members can support it"
