      "Housing and marriage are not relevant to stratification",
      "Change in occupational class can coexist with caste boundaries and discrimination in other domains",
      "Caste exclusion proves occupational mobility did not occur",
      "The worker's experience can only be explained by ritual rank; this follows from using ritual standing as the organising explanation for local resource access and social influence"
