    "a": 3,
    "hint": "Different dimensions of stratification may change at different rates.",
    "e": "Class position and caste relations intersect but are not identical. A change in occupation is evidence of mobility in one domain; it does not establish that caste boundaries or discrimination have disappeared elsewhere.",
