    "a": 0,
    "hint": "The person protects self-esteem by explaining outcomes in a favourable direction.",
    "e": "Self-serving bias often involves attributing success to internal qualities and failure to external causes. It can protect self-esteem but can also impede accurate learning from mistakes.",
