    "hint": "An expectation alters treatment in ways that help bring about the expected outcome.",
    "e": "A self-fulfilling prophecy occurs when an expectation influences behaviour or conditions in a way that helps produce the expected result. The vignette suggests a possible mechanism; it does not prove the expectation was the sole cause of achievement change.",
