    "hint": "Consider the combination of numbers, economic resources, status and political influence rather than ritual rank alone.",
    "e": "Srinivas's dominant caste concept explains local influence through a combination of numerical strength, land or economic resources, education and political power. Dominance need not coincide perfectly with the highest ritual status.",
    "source": "https://egyankosh.ac.in/bitstream/123456789/5437/1/MWG-009B1E-U1.pdf"
