    "a": 3,
    "hint": "Institutions can offer support and reproduce social boundaries at the same time.",
    "e": "Caste associations may mobilise resources and solidarity while also reinforcing boundaries and norms. A sociological analysis examines who benefits, who is constrained and how members experience those functions differently.",
