    "a": 1,
    "hint": "Consider both new capabilities and the concentration of control over resources or markets.",
    "e": "Global integration can increase connectivity and opportunity but also create dependency when bargaining power and market control are uneven. The analysis should identify which actors gain control, not treat integration as wholly beneficial or harmful.",
