    "hint": "The absence may be a response to an unsafe environment rather than lack of interest in education.",
    "e": "An inclusive response investigates the barrier, protects privacy, addresses harassment and works with the student on safe access. Penalising absence without addressing the environment can deepen exclusion.",
    "source": "https://www.unicef.org/education/bullying"
