    "hint": "Food availability is only one determinant; consider access, disease exposure, care practices and power.",
    "e": "Malnutrition is shaped by multiple interacting determinants, including food security, health services, sanitation, caregiving and gendered control of resources. A single awareness campaign or production indicator will not capture the whole problem.",
