    "hint": "Resource constraints do not erase duties to oppose discrimination and protect equitable access.",
    "e": "Social work values human dignity, participation and social justice. A funding condition that discriminates conflicts with these commitments; the agency should resist exclusion and seek alternatives while being transparent about service impacts.",
