    "hint": "Examine how authority and interpretation shape the operation of formal rules.",
    "e": "Weberian analysis attends to authority, legitimacy, bureaucracy and the meanings guiding action. The case contrasts formal categories with how actors interpret and apply them through unequal influence.",
