    "s": "Advanced Practice - Sociology",
    "module": 1,
    "q": "A city attributes rising homelessness to a sudden increase in individual irresponsibility. Housing costs doubled while wages stagnated, and eviction filings cluster in a few low-income wards. Which sociological question should guide the next inquiry?",
