    "hint": "Look for the framework that examines competing interests, power and the reproduction of inequality.",
    "e": "Conflict approaches examine how institutions and rules can reflect unequal power and advantage some groups. A complete analysis would also investigate the rule's origins, enforcement and effects rather than assume intent from unequal outcomes alone.",
