    "a": 2,
    "hint": "Formal access and the time, mobility and support needed to participate can differ by gender.",
    "e": "A sociological account examines how household expectations distribute time and mobility, shaping effective educational participation. Enrolment is an important but incomplete measure, and the case should not be generalised without broader evidence.",
