    "a": 5,
    "hint": "Communities can combine market and non-market livelihood relations in different ways.",
    "e": "A binary between isolation and full market integration oversimplifies livelihood strategies. Sociological analysis maps wage work, exchange, forest use and remittances and examines how these relations vary across households and over time.",
