    "hint": "A comparison should investigate mechanisms and competing explanations rather than infer causation from two cases alone.",
    "e": "Comparative fieldwork can examine how enforcement, reporting access and local power relate to practice, but differences between two villages do not by themselves identify a causal effect. Multiple forms of evidence and temporal analysis strengthen the explanation.",
