    "a": 3,
    "hint": "Privacy conditions may affect what respondents are willing or able to report.",
    "e": "Sensitive questions about household control may be answered differently when relatives are present. Private interviewing and ethical safeguards improve the evidence, while the observed association still requires analysis of other household differences.",
