    "a": 1,
    "hint": "A projection describes what follows from its assumptions; it is not a guaranteed future count.",
    "e": "The no-migration projection remains useful as a baseline if its assumptions are explicit. Scenario analysis can test how alternative migration patterns affect housing and service needs without claiming any scenario is certain.",
