    "a": 5,
    "hint": "Participation concerns more than extraction of testimony; consider who interprets and benefits from knowledge.",
    "e": "Participatory practice includes meaningful involvement and accountability to those whose knowledge is used. Returning findings and discussing interpretation can support reciprocity, although procedures must also protect privacy and avoid overpromising control.",
