    "hint": "Separate programme outputs from changes in agency and the opportunity structure.",
    "e": "Completion is an output, not sufficient evidence of empowerment. Measures should assess agency, control and access as defined with participants, while considering social constraints that may limit conversion of skills into opportunities.",
