    "a": 4,
    "hint": "Question whether the analytical framework makes one society the norm and another a deviation.",
    "e": "Concepts developed in one historical setting may not travel unchanged. Comparative research needs conceptual scrutiny and local knowledge so difference is not automatically interpreted as absence or failure relative to one path.",
