    "s": "Advanced Practice - Sociology",
    "module": 2,
    "q": "An urban neighbourhood has temples, mosques and churches within one block. A municipal report uses this spatial proximity to conclude that interreligious relations are harmonious, while residents describe segregated housing and unequal access to municipal repairs. What evidence would best evaluate the claim?",
