    "hint": "Who occupies the office and who exercises its authority may differ.",
    "e": "Representation requires more than a seat or formal eligibility. Evidence about independent voice, decision authority and accountability reveals whether women can exercise office; proxy attendance may be a key mechanism that formal headcounts conceal.",
