      "Assume workers prefer hazardous jobs, designing the response on that inference although the case does not establish local institutions, statutory rights, and lived social relations.",
      "Conclude factories have no effect because supervisors remain privileged, giving the responsible institution’s account priority because its representatives oversee the relevant procedures"
