    "hint": "Sectoral entry can coexist with segmented labour markets and unequal returns within the same workplace.",
    "e": "Factory work changes occupational location but may reproduce inequality through segmentation, risk and blocked advancement. A sound analysis distinguishes entry from job quality and mobility and investigates how caste, class and institutional rules shape allocation.",
