      "Replace local language with English, using it as the main interpretation without establishing selection, non-response, and the target population.",
      "Infer routine exclusion from caste identity alone, designing the response on that inference although the case does not establish who declines or cannot safely participate.",
      "Remove the item because concepts cannot be compared across languages, reducing exposure to the setting associated with the difficulty while the institution maintains its standard arrangements",
