    "a": 0,
    "hint": "Standard wording does not guarantee that the construct has the same meaning across languages or respondents.",
    "e": "Literal translation may not preserve conceptual meaning. Cognitive testing and behaviourally specific items can improve construct validity while documentation clarifies trade-offs in cross-site comparison; imposing a definition without testing can shape responses rather than measure experience.",
