      "Concentrate the comparison on total membership before and after, using the observed time pattern to distinguish the programme period from the conditions that preceded it",
      "Use social-media post volume as the participation measure, treating digital engagement counts as evidence that users can obtain and use the service described",
      "Track who can access meetings, speak, shape decisions and remain involved across online and offline channels, disaggregating attrition and device control",
      "Interpret the evidence as indicating that online access is inherently more inclusive, using access to the digital channel as the principal indicator of ability to complete the service process",
