    "hint": "A visible digital presence may coexist with exclusion from deliberation and organisational continuity.",
    "e": "Public communication does not reveal who participates in decisions or who has been excluded by device and access barriers. Multi-channel participation measures and disaggregated attrition can show whether digital visibility broadens voice or shifts costs onto less-connected members.",
