    "hint": "A budget line's intended beneficiaries do not determine who receives an accessible service or controls its governance.",
    "e": "Infrastructure spending may have unequal spatial effects, and women's labour responsibilities do not guarantee their decision power. A gender audit measures actual access and time effects, disaggregates location and examines participation in design and maintenance rather than classifying expenditure by intention alone.",
