    "hint": "A non-statutory agency cannot replace the designated authority responsible for children in need of care and protection.",
    "e": "Under the JJ Act, the CWC has statutory responsibility for children in need of care and protection. The agency should support safe production, assessment and coordinated planning, not substitute its own indefinite placement or criminal investigation for the designated process.",
