    "hint": "A closure metric is not a substitute for a safe transition and clear responsibility.",
    "e": "Administrative targets should not override the assessed safety needs of a child. Accountable assignment, timely follow-up and documented review provide continuity and allow supervisors to address both the case risk and any performance system that incentivises premature closure.",
