    "hint": "A dwelling allocation is an output; the relevant outcome includes whether residents can sustain life and work there.",
    "e": "Relocation can improve physical housing while undermining access to work and services. Following the full household cohort, including returnees, exposes displacement costs that a site-based satisfaction survey or construction count misses.",
