    "a": 2,
    "hint": "A programme can change the probability that an existing problem becomes visible to services.",
    "e": "Outreach may increase awareness, trust and disclosure, so helpline volume is affected by access as well as incidence. Independent, repeated confidential measurement and linked response data help separate prevalence from reporting changes.",
