    "a": 4,
    "hint": "Absenteeism is a risk signal, not a specific diagnosis of labour exploitation.",
    "e": "Combining signals and validating them reduces both missed cases and inappropriate accusations. A safe, non-punitive response is essential because an erroneous label can harm families and undermine trust in schools and protection services.",
