      "Close claims after one notice, ending assessment at that point and leaving who captures the subsidy and who bears housing costs unexamined.",
      "Require more property records, using it as a uniform safeguard while assuming the same rule protects everyone, without assessing tenant outcomes rather than landlord enrollment totals.",
      "Provide accessible alternative evidence and appeals, assess distinct losses including tenancy and livelihoods, and audit approval rates by affected group"
