      "Penalise missed appointments, using it as the main interpretation without establishing safety, access, and harms that may be hidden or displaced.",
      "Exclude reopened cases, reducing exposure to the setting associated with the difficulty while the institution maintains its standard arrangements",
      "Concentrate the comparison on the average closure time, using the summary value to represent the typical experience of the population being assessed",
      "Set a shorter closure deadline, using it as the main interpretation without establishing safety, access, and harms that may be hidden or displaced."
