      "Publish the shelter address and resident list, using identifiable information to make cases open to verification and strengthen public accountability",
      "Allocate beds only by app timestamp, using access to the digital channel as the principal indicator of ability to complete the service process",
      "Compare application downloads with the eligible population and use installation rates as the principal indicator of effective digital access",
      "Require everyone to use the app"
