    "a": 0,
    "hint": "The reservation process assumes device access and can make an unconfirmed digital booking block a needed bed.",
    "e": "A safe access system needs alternatives for people without devices and a way to reconcile reservations with actual occupancy. Monitoring turnaways and privacy risks tests whether digital administration improves or restricts protection.",
