    "a": 2,
    "hint": "The sampling schedule may systematically miss the people whose work patterns differ from the selected interview window.",
    "e": "Time-location sampling across varied periods improves representation of mobile workers. Validating the proposed zones with groups who were previously missed tests whether the plan serves their livelihoods and care constraints.",
    "source": "https://www.ilo.org/resource/news/informal-economy-and-decent-work"
