    "a": 4,
    "hint": "Attitudes and actual gatekeeping behaviour can diverge, so a second method should observe decisions rather than declarations alone.",
    "e": "Multiple methods compare stated attitudes with consequential decisions. Carefully governed audit or administrative analyses can reveal patterns while ethical safeguards protect applicants and avoid exposing individuals unfairly.",
    "source": "https://www.ilo.org/topics/employment-promotion"
