    "a": 3,
    "hint": "A change in jurisdiction can change the count even if children and their needs remain the same.",
    "e": "Consistent boundaries and case-transfer tracking distinguish real change from administrative redistribution. Reporting continuity across districts ensures that transferred cases do not disappear from accountability or service follow-up.",
