    "a": 2,
    "hint": "A policing context can deter participation and overrepresent people already known to enforcement services.",
    "e": "Independent recruitment broadens the sample beyond service contacts and reduces the perceived consequences of disclosure. Clear separation from enforcement is important to candour, safety and valid prevalence estimates.",
