    "s": "Advanced Practice - Sociology",
    "module": 4,
    "q": "A city offers a central registration point for street vendors. Vendors who arrive early to secure a place lose the first hours of earnings, while those with caregiving duties arrive too late to register. Which process redesign best reduces unequal access?",
