    "a": 5,
    "hint": "Household receipt does not establish how resources are distributed or who exercises control within the household.",
    "e": "Individual-level measures reveal whether the intended recipient can participate and benefit. Confidentiality and retaliation safeguards are crucial because collecting intra-household information can create risks if shared indiscriminately.",
    "source": "https://www.un.org/development/desa/disabilities/convention-on-the-rights-of-persons-with-disabilities.html"
