    "a": 2,
    "hint": "The audience and power dynamics can constrain what participants feel safe enough to say in a group.",
    "e": "Confidential methods and safe facilitation reduce pressure to agree publicly. Clear data protection and response plans help participants understand the limits and purpose of disclosure without exposing them to retaliation.",
