      "Close cases after one pay cycle, ending assessment at that point and leaving time-varying confounding and alternative explanations unexamined.",
      "Count jobs offered, treating it as the principal success measure and inferring real improvement from its total without checking the assignment process before interpreting outcomes.",
      "Exclude workers who change employers, giving the responsible institution’s account priority because its representatives oversee the relevant procedures",
      "Count new contracts, treating it as the principal success measure and inferring real improvement from its total without checking baseline risk, timing, and selection into exposure."
