      "Let neighbours decide, using it as the main interpretation without establishing safety, access, and harms that may be hidden or displaced.",
      "Treat refusal as lack of remorse, interpreting the observed decision as an expression of the person’s preferred available arrangement",
      "Exclude the person from services, reducing exposure to the setting associated with the difficulty while the institution maintains its standard arrangements",
