      "Require workers to carry the card, using it as a uniform safeguard while assuming the same rule protects everyone, without assessing safety, access, and harms that may be hidden or displaced.",
      "Use workplace supervisors as first contacts, giving the responsible institution’s account priority because its representatives oversee the relevant procedures",
      "Distribute more cards through employers, giving the responsible institution’s account priority because its representatives oversee the relevant procedures",
