    "hint": "An outreach route can become unsafe when the person controlling the worker also controls how information is delivered.",
    "e": "Independent delivery and recipient-chosen contact reduce disclosure risks. Safe-channel assessment is more important than distribution volume because a visible card may increase danger rather than improve access.",
