    "hint": "The two sources may measure different evidence of vaccination and have different coverage gaps.",
    "e": "Explicit definitions and separate reporting of card-verified and caregiver-reported status preserve information about both sources. Clinic records can miss vaccinations elsewhere, while recall can overstate or misdate events, so neither should automatically replace the other.",
    "source": "https://www.who.int/publications/i/item/9789241513869"
