    "a": 2,
    "hint": "People recruited through the same service and network may share occupation, geography and experiences.",
    "e": "Snowball sampling can reach hidden populations, but the sample is shaped by network connections and initial seeds. A narrow convenience network does not support a district prevalence estimate without a defensible sampling model and assumptions.",
    "source": "https://www.cdc.gov/field-epi-manual/php/chapters/conducting-surveys.html"
