    "s": "Advanced Practice - Sociology",
    "module": 5,
    "q": "A research team translates a validated questionnaire into a local language using literal word-for-word substitution. Respondents interpret 'household head' as the oldest man, while the original construct referred to the person responsible for decisions. Which adaptation process is most appropriate?",
