    "hint": "Pre-existing differences and trends can explain post-policy gaps independently of the intervention.",
    "e": "Difference-in-differences can remove time-invariant differences if the parallel-trends assumption is credible. Pre-trend checks and sensitivity analysis assess that assumption; post-only means cannot address baseline selection.",
    "source": "https://www.povertyactionlab.org/resource/difference-differences"
