      "Sampling adequacy should be judged by the number of observations, because a sufficiently large dataset stabilises the estimate used for the population",
      "Recall support differs systematically and may create differential measurement by education; standardise neutral aids and assess recall validity across groups",
      "Calendar use always causes undercounting, using it as the main interpretation without establishing people excluded from the recruitment route."
