    "hint": "Different memory aids may change reporting accuracy and are not evenly distributed.",
    "e": "Recall aids can improve accuracy but also create mode differences correlated with respondent characteristics. Standardised use and validation reduce differential error; remaining limitations should be described, especially for long recall periods.",
