      "Use a disclaimer instead of protection, treating it as the main response and assuming it resolves the stated problem without testing valid measurement, sampling, comparison, and participant safety.",
      "Keep exact points in every public chart, using it as the main interpretation without establishing valid measurement, sampling, comparison, and participant safety.",
      "Assess re-identification and retaliation risks, restrict precise coordinates, aggregate or mask locations, and publish only what is necessary for the analytic purpose",
