    "hint": "The analysis excludes people whose characteristics may directly affect whether they can complete the measure.",
    "e": "Completer selection may systematically remove people with sensory or literacy barriers and alter the observed performance distribution. Accessible alternatives and transparent completion analysis are needed for fair and valid inference.",
