      "The main limitation occurs at the sensory receptors, where sustained stimulation reduces the strength of the incoming signal.",
      "The pattern reflects a stricter response threshold, with the stimulus remaining consciously available but less likely to be reported.",
      "The change is chiefly a memory retrieval effect, because the information was consciously perceived when originally presented.",
