      "Prioritise inherited biological predispositions and use the present behaviour as an indicator of the underlying constitutional tendency.",
      "Account for the pattern through the immediate reinforcement history, treating reported beliefs as descriptions of the learned response.",
      "Explain the outcome through a general developmental stage, with individual experience affecting the pace rather than the underlying sequence."
