    "a": 2,
    "hint": "Rogers emphasized fit between self-understanding and lived experience.",
    "e": "Rogers's humanistic theory highlights congruence between self-concept and experience. Exploring discrepancies can clarify distress and the conditions that support more authentic self-understanding.",
