      "Seek reassurance from a family member and use their willingness to provide support as the main basis for continuing routine care",
      "Administer a brief screening measure and use the resulting score as the threshold for deciding whether escalation is necessary",
      "Focus on establishing rapport during the current contact and postpone detailed risk questions until the person is more comfortable",
