      "Explain the expected behavior once and use the person's ability to repeat the rule as evidence that they can apply it under pressure",
      "Show the undesired behavior in detail to emphasize its seriousness and rely on discussion afterward to determine what observers learn",
      "Choose a high-status model regardless of the model's relevance to the learner and expect imitation to follow from admiration alone",
