    "a": 4,
    "hint": "Describing an undesirable behavior as common can signal that it is normal.",
    "e": "A message emphasizing that many people do not donate may inadvertently establish nonparticipation as a descriptive norm. Accurate positive norms and clear, voluntary requests may work better.",
