    "a": 1,
    "hint": "Exposure differs, but attendance dose is not randomly assigned and may be related to learner characteristics.",
    "e": "Dose-stratified results can show patterns, but attendance may correlate with motivation, access or prior knowledge. Interpret associations cautiously and consider baseline differences rather than claiming a causal dose-response from raw averages.",
