    "hint": "Focus groups can reveal shared meanings and differences through discussion, not just individual votes.",
    "e": "Focus groups are suited to exploring views and interaction around a topic. Closed questions may limit explanation; for prevalence estimates, a representative survey is more appropriate than a small group discussion.",
