    "hint": "Referral effectiveness depends on connection to service, not referral initiation alone.",
    "e": "A completed-referral measure with a time period assesses whether families reach the service. Reasons for non-completion identify barriers such as eligibility, transport, wait time or service capacity.",
    "source": "https://www.unicef.org/ethiopia/reports/monitoring-evaluation-and-learning-mel-guideline"
