    "a": 1,
    "hint": "Recognition can value learning acquired outside formal courses while maintaining clear standards.",
    "e": "Adult-learning policy can recognize, validate and accredit outcomes from non-formal and informal learning. Transparent competency assessment supports progression without equating experience alone with demonstrated mastery.",
