    "a": 5,
    "hint": "Composite scores can obscure which dimensions changed and how much each contributed.",
    "e": "Separate components support diagnosis and decision-making; the composite may remain as a summary if its construction and weights are transparent and pre-specified. A rising score does not imply every component improved.",
