    "a": 0,
    "hint": "Consensus claims require evidence about who participated and how disagreement could be expressed.",
    "e": "Verify representation, facilitation and dissent mechanisms with participants. A statement of unanimity from the chair is not enough to establish inclusive agreement, especially where power differences may silence disagreement.",
