      "Interpret adequate performance in another setting as evidence that the reported difficulty is mainly motivational or situational preference.",
      "Use a single standardised screening score to determine the primary diagnosis and organise subsequent support around that classification.",
      "Ask about use and symptoms without judgment, advise against unverified products and arrange qualified assessment of poor appetite",
