      "Weight each observed participant equally, on the assumption that a consistent questionnaire makes recruitment differences unimportant.",
      "Use the response rate among people successfully contacted as the coverage measure, with unreachable people outside the reporting denominator.",
      "Select respondents who provide the most complete information, then generalise their average to the full target population.",
