    "a": 0,
    "hint": "Ecological thinking considers multiple levels and reciprocal influence.",
    "e": "An ecological formulation considers the client, close relationships, organizations and wider policy or cultural conditions. It avoids reducing complex distress to one cause and helps identify intervention points across levels.",
