    "e": "Systems thinking recognizes that family, health, education and social services interact. Coordination can reduce gaps and contradictory plans while sharing only information authorized or required for the purpose.",
    "source": "https://www.ifsw.org/what-is-social-work/global-definition-of-social-work/"
