    "a": 0,
    "hint": "Observed participation is shaped by access, timing, trust and perceived influence.",
    "e": "Low turnout may reflect opportunity costs, prior exclusion, inaccessible scheduling or lack of trust. Ask residents how they prefer to participate and evaluate whether input changes decisions.",
