    "a": 0,
    "hint": "People can contribute labour without having decision-making power.",
    "e": "Participation ranges from token involvement to shared decision authority. An empowerment approach asks whether residents set priorities, shape choices and control resources, not merely whether they carried out assigned tasks.",
