    "a": 1,
    "hint": "Net progress must include who bears costs and whether rights or livelihoods are harmed.",
    "e": "Averages can conceal serious harms. Rights-based evaluation examines distribution, participation, remedies and unintended effects for affected groups, not only aggregate gains.",
    "source": "https://www.ohchr.org/en/instruments-mechanisms/instruments/international-covenant-economic-social-and-cultural-rights"
