      "Retain the standard procedure to ensure equal treatment and offer additional reminders to help the person comply with its requirements",
      "Develop an accessible orientation that explains limits, invites questions and gains agreement without promising perfect secrecy",
      "Ask a relative or community volunteer to manage the practical steps, using their availability to keep the current service arrangements unchanged",
