    "a": 2,
    "hint": "Structure supports the group, but responsiveness may be necessary when context changes.",
    "e": "The facilitator should assess urgency and consult members about adjusting the agenda. A flexible process can respond to context while maintaining boundaries and the group's broader purpose.",
