      "Use the account given by the most senior professional as the working version and revise it if another agency produces contrary evidence",
      "Record the most likely explanation as the case finding so the next worker can make a timely decision without repeating the assessment",
      "Assess total lifecycle costs and responsibilities before accepting, and decline or negotiate if the resource is not sustainable",
