      "Read the standard information more slowly and accept a verbal yes as confirmation that the person understands the important choices",
      "Provide the usual written material for later review and complete the decision now using the person's understanding of everyday conversation",
      "Check comprehension and allow material questions before applying the agreed decision rule",
