    "a": 5,
    "hint": "Consent to one service or meeting does not automatically cover every application and disclosure.",
    "e": "Each application and data use should be explained in terms the client can understand, with consent and safe contact preferences confirmed. A case conference cannot substitute for the person’s choice unless a specific legal authority applies.",
