    "hint": "A delivery model can succeed in one context and fail where barriers differ.",
    "e": "Replication should preserve the model’s effective elements while adapting to local access conditions and available capacity. Monitoring by location and population group shows whether adaptation is closing gaps rather than merely reproducing an urban format.",
