    "hint": "An audit that relies only on the implementing agency may miss how delivery works for recipients.",
    "e": "Independent and beneficiary perspectives can identify discrepancies and barriers not visible in official records. Participation should be structured to protect privacy and prevent retaliation while maintaining a fair process.",
